"   mido                                                                                                                █"
"                                                                                               ╭ Outline ────────────╮ █"
"  mido: Markdown In, Document Out.                                                             │                     │ █"
"                                                                                               │  ▾ mido             │ █"
"  A terminal Markdown reader that renders documents the way a good reader app does: real       │  ├   Install        │ █"
"  heading hierarchy, a comfortable line measure, syntax-highlighted code, and tables that      │  ├   Use            │ █"
"  line up. Built in Rust on ratatui (https://ratatui.rs).                                      │  ├   Keys           │ █"
"                                                                                               │  └   What renders   │ █"
"                                                                                               │                     │ │"
"  Install                                                                                      ╰─────────────────────╯ │"
"  ───────                                                                                                              │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"  ▎ cargo install --path .                                                                 sh                          │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"  Use                                                                                                                  │"
"  ───                                                                                                                  │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"  ▎ mido README.md          # open the viewer                                              sh                          │"
"  ▎ mido -                  # read Markdown from stdin                                                                 │"
"  ▎ mido -p README.md       # print styled text to stdout, pipe it to less -R                                          │"
"  ▎ mido -w 80 notes.md     # cap the width (default: full terminal width)                                             │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"  Piping without  -p  prints plain text, so  mido file.md > out.txt  never leaks escape                                │"
"  codes.                                                                                                               │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"  Keys                                                                                                                 │"
"  ────                                                                                                                 │"
" stdin                                                                                              ? help  q quit  Top "
